# Shared Components

Purpose: uniform reusable UI built on Flutter Material primitives.

## Mandatory rules

- Prefer Flutter Material/Cupertino widgets; wrap only for consistency or repeated behavior.
- Keep shared components minimal, flexible, and stable.
- Do not create multiple components for the same job.
- Do not put product-specific business logic in shared components.
- All user-facing labels, hints, validation messages, and accessibility labels come from localization.
- Components support enabled, disabled, loading, error, focused, and empty states where relevant.
- Components adapt to supported screen sizes and input methods.
- Components use [`design-system.mdc`](./design-system.mdc) tokens for colors, spacing, typography, radius, and elevation.
- Before creating new UI, check `lib/shared/` for an existing component; add reusable widgets there, one-off widgets in the feature.

## Standard catalog

| Component | Built on | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `AppButton` | `FilledButton`, `OutlinedButton`, `TextButton` | primary, secondary, tertiary actions |
| `AppIconButton` | `IconButton` | compact icon actions with semantic labels |
| `AppTextField` | `TextFormField` | text, number, password, multiline |
| `AppSelectField<T>` | `DropdownMenu<T>` or Material menus | searchable selection |
| `AppRadioGroup<T>` | `RadioGroup` / `RadioListTile` | exclusive options |
| `AppCheckboxField` | `CheckboxListTile` | boolean option |
| `AppSwitchField` | `SwitchListTile` | setting toggle |
| `AppDateField` | date picker primitives | locale-aware date input |
| `AppDialog` | `Dialog` / `AlertDialog` | consistent modals |
| `AsyncStateScaffold` | composition | loading, empty, error, success ([`ui-feedback.mdc`](./ui-feedback.mdc)) |
| `ResponsivePage` | layout | page padding and max-width ([`layouts.mdc`](./layouts.mdc)) |
| `ResponsiveAppShell` | `Scaffold`, `NavigationRail`, `MenuBar` | mobile/tablet/desktop shell |
| `AppMenuBar` | `MenuBar` | desktop/web app-level actions |
| `SideNavigation` | `NavigationRail` or Material composition | collapsed/expanded side nav |

**Naming:** public widget `ResponsiveAppShell` lives in `lib/shared/layout/responsive_shell_scaffold.dart`.

## Styling bounds

- Icons: `20–24px` unless layout requires larger.
- Button heights: `40–48px`.
- Radii: `8–12px`.
- Use text plus icons for important navigation or status items where space allows.

## Form components

- Expose validation hooks; do not own feature validation rules.
- Searchable selects use overlays/menus, not pushing unrelated content down by default.
- Date fields use locale-aware formatting.
- Password fields provide accessible show/hide when used.

